      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12381287::web::021::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed equilibrium-driven mechanism should not apply under rapid quenching, mechanical alloying, melt spinning, or other strongly non-equilibrium processing.",
